Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: subgraph_matching (validates ADR 0015)
Purpose:
    Confirm the subgraph-matching-backed attach pass finds instances
    that ADR 0014's compound-class pipeline fragmented. Verify the
    cleanness filter correctly rejects embedded cases (2-chains
    inside cycles) and retains genuine ones.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0015 (find_instances_of, expand_connected, cleanness filter,
    rewired run_naming_pass attach_only branch).
    Source: v2/src/lib.rs at the commit implementing 0015.
    Runner: v2/examples/subgraph_matching.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example subgraph_matching

